      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it may be a slightly different issue, but it (redownloading content that i definitely had cached in my 200GB of cache) happened to me only the first time i loaded each piece of content in the beta.\n\nsomething seem to have changed with cache file paths, and the folder containing the specific version of the avatar is now named differently, so the file was \"missing\" and had to be redownloaded\n\nthe __data files in both of the folders in the attachments below are identical.\n\nfor clarity obviously i haven't modified this avatar in the meantime",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6740030871c7451a995739cf",
